    <string name="settings_detailed_title">vistrita adhyayana</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">sutra-yojita sravana-yantra-yugma cha avadhih-gita-kala-yogga kartum. android-asya sutra-yojita samyojana-samchara-goshthisu jivanta-karyakrama-vah eva samprajapana karoti, tat-anantaram etad sukhi-suchana-gana-sthanam karoti. bluetooth sahaja-margena adhyayate.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">bluetooth adhikara-dvayah pradana-kale apraptavya - etad nirmana-grama-dhisthana-sthapana-seva-praka-dvarah, yatah android 14+ bluetooth adhikara-dvayah yojita.</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">avadhih-gita-kale-eva gana-kartvi</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">samkhya-laksha-goshthisu samyojita-kala vah vastutah avadhih-gita-kala-vah parimiti karoti. adhyayana-gana vistrita adhyayana-gana-saha avadhih-gita-kala-parimitir bhavati - itara-vah vigata-bhavanti.</string>
